6,Survey of languages spoken on Maewo - researchdata.edu.au,https://researchdata.edu.au/survey-languages-spoken-maewo/,"A survey of languages spoken on Maewo (Vanuatu) in 2018. The collection contains: Austronesian Basic Vocabulary Database (ABVD) wordlist of 215 terms, kinship surveys and ethnographic interviews.","Maewo, Central",Austronesian
7,"Maewo, Central Language (MWO) – L1 & L2 ... - Ethnologue",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/mwo/,"Central Maewo is an endangered indigenous language of Vanuatu. It belongs to the Austronesian language family. The language is used as a first language by all adults in the ethnic community, but not all young people. It is not known to be taught in schools.","Maewo, Central",Austronesian
